---
layout: default
---
<div class="work-shell">
  <p class="work-kicker">Portfolio</p>
  <h1>Selected work</h1>
  <p class="work-intro">
    The site now treats projects as a small set of substantial engineering stories rather than a long list of isolated pages. The most complete
    standalone project is
    <a href="https://leahsylee.github.io/GelSphere/">GelSphere</a>; the rest are summarized here with direct links where a deeper artifact exists.
  </p>

  <section class="work-section-header work-section">
    <div class="work-section-copy">
      <p class="work-kicker">Research</p>
      <h2>Lab work with build-test-iterate loops</h2>
      <p>These projects are strongest when the mechanical design, sensing, and experimental validation are all considered together.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% for item in site.data.work.featured %}
    {% assign item_href = item.href %}
    {% assign item_external = false %}
    {% if item_href contains '://' or item_href contains 'mailto:' %}
      {% assign item_external = true %}
    {% else %}
      {% assign item_href = item_href | relative_url %}
    {% endif %}
    <section class="work-section" id="{{ item.slug }}">
      <div class="work-section-copy">
        <span class="work-chip">{{ item.type }}</span>
        <h2 class="work-section-title">
          <a
            href="{{ item_href }}"
            {% if item_external %}
              target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            {% endif %}
          >
            {{ item.title }}
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p>{{ item.summary }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="work-section-side">
        <p>
          <strong>{{ item.context }}</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="work-card-links">
          {% for link in item.links %}
            {% assign link_href = link.url %}
            {% assign link_external = false %}
            {% if link_href contains '://' or link_href contains 'mailto:' %}
              {% assign link_external = true %}
            {% else %}
              {% assign link_href = link_href | relative_url %}
            {% endif %}
            <a
              href="{{ link_href }}"
              {% if link_external %}
                target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              {% endif %}
            >
              {{ link.label }}
            </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}

  <section class="work-section-header">
    <div class="work-section-copy">
      <p class="work-kicker">Additional builds</p>
      <h2>Smaller projects with clear constraints</h2>
      <p>
        These are shorter-form builds, but they still show the kind of engineering work I like most: concrete constraints, physical prototypes, and
        measurable outcomes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="work-grid">
    {% for item in site.data.work.additional %}
      {% include work_card.liquid item=item %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {% if content != blank %}
    <section class="home-section home-note">
      {{ content }}
    </section>
  {% endif %}
</div>
